{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S04、S05、S07、S13等段的感受行明显密集，纵向扫读比X的双栏分区更费眼；分时出现能缓解，但不能完全消除这个问题。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把每段叙事的关键转折加亮，普通观众更容易迅速抓住人物此刻在想什么、为什么这样做，尤其是从害怕暴露心意，到渴望相互依靠，再到接受无法保证永远的心理变化，层次更清楚。它的感受描写也更具体，既有身体感、情绪变化，又有旋律、和声、音色与水波、小船等意象的呼应，S14还把开头的意象和结尾接了起来，整体听觉与叙事更像一件完整的事。X的优势是信息分区清楚、扫读负担较轻，但人物心理和音乐感受之间的对应没有Y那么细致。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c18d191d-acda-41e4-a192-9ce30fdb11b2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T181905559884Z", "elapsed_seconds": 119.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:21:05.476460+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "acac702557160a106010fe2a604edc23361e092eee920f34ae5c14dbbec5748b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb